{
  "id": "DEU.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Gusubiramwo 17",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuze mushikanire ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu inka canke intama igwaye canke ifise agasembwa, ni ikizira kuri we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nihagira umugabo canke umugore muri mwebwe wo mu gisagara na kimwe mu vyo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu azoba yarabahaye muzosanga ariko akora ibibi mu nyonga z’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu, arenga kw’isezerano, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akarenga ku mabwirizwa yanje, agasenga izindi mana, akazunamira canke akunamira izuba, ukwezi canke inyenyeri zo mu kirere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukamwumva muze mutohoze neza. Nimwasanga koko ico kizira carakozwe mu Bisirayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muzofate uwo mugore canke uwo mugabo yabikoze mumutware kw’irembo ry’igisagara canyu, mumwicishe amabuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azokwicwe habanje kuboneka ivyabona bibiri canke bitatu, ariko ntihazogire uwicwa habajijwe icabona kimwe gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi icabona kizobe ari co kibanza kumutera ibuye, abandi na bo bazokurikire. Mutegerezwa gukura ikibi muri mwebwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nihagira imanza zigoye babazanira, zaba iz’ubwicanyi canke ugukomeretsanya, muzozitware muri ca kibanza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu azoba yaratoranije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzozishikirize abaherezi ari bo Balewi, canke umucamanza azoba ari ku gikorwa ico gihe. Bazoheza barwumvirize hanyuma baruce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzokurikize ico bazobabwirira mu kibanza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " azoba yaratoranije. Muze mube maso kugira ngo mukore ico bazobabwira cose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mukore mukurikije ivyo babigishije vyose n’ivyo bababwiye vyose. Ntimuze muhengamire i buryo canke i bubamfu rw’ivyo bababwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nihagira uwishira hejuru akanka urubanza umucamanza canke umuherezi azoba ahagaze akorera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu azoba yaciye, aze yicwe. Muzoba mukuye ikibi mu Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bose bazovyumva batinye, maze birinde kwishira hejuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwashika mu gihugu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu abahaye, mukagifata kikaba icanyu, mukakibamwo, hanyuma mukiyumvira muti: “Reka twiyimikire umwami natwe nk’ayandi mahanga adukikuje,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muze mube maso kugira ngo mwimike uwo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu azoba yabahitiyemwo. Azobe umwe muri benewanyu b’Abisirayeli. Ntimuze mwimike umunyamahanga, atari Umwisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mwami ntaze atunge ifarasi nyinshi canke ngo arungike abantu muri Egiputa kuzironderayo, kuko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yababwiye ati: “Ntimuze mwigere musubira gufata inzira ija muri Egiputa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntaze agire abagore benshi, kuko umutima wiwe wohava uta inzira ukava k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ntazokwirundanirize inzahabu n’ifeza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyamara gufata intebe y’ubwami, azokwiyandikishirize ikopi y’igitabu c’ibi Vyagezwe, agikuye muri kirya c’abaherezi, ari bo Balewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azocamane kandi azokwame agisoma imisi yose y’ukubaho kwiwe, kugira ngo amenye ingene yubaha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yiwe, n’ingene yokurikiza amajambo y’Ivyagezwe n’amategeko ari muri co. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizomufasha kwirinda kwifata nk’aho asumba benewabo, canke guhengamira i buryo canke i bubamfu ngo ave muri ya mategeko. Ni ho we n’uruvyaro rwiwe bazorambira ku ngoma muri Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
